        "url": "/api/v2/version/26/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ekans si attorciglia a spirale per riposarsi. In questa posizione\nriesce a reagire alle insidie provenienti da ogni parte grazie\nalla testa sollevata e allo sguardo fulminante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "alpha-sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/26/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ekans curls itself up in a spiral while it rests. Assuming this\nposition allows it to quickly respond to a threat from any\ndirection with a glare from its upraised head.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "alpha-sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/26/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ぐるぐる　体を　巻いて　休んでいるのは\nどの　方向から　敵が　襲ってきても\nとっさに　頭を　向けて　威嚇できるからだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
