        "url": "/api/v2/version/26/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "アゴを　はずすことで　じぶんより\nおおきな　えものも　まるのみにする。\nしょくごは　からだを　まるめ　やすむ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "턱을 빼 자신보다\n큰 먹이를 통째로 삼킨다.\n식후에는 몸을 둥글게 하고 쉰다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會藉由讓下顎脫臼\n來吞食比自己更大的獵物。\n進食之後會蜷縮起身子休息。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il peut se déboîter la mâchoire pour avaler\ntout rond des proies plus grosses que lui.\nIl se replie ensuite sur lui-même pour digérer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es hängt seinen Kiefer aus und verschlingt so\nselbst größere Beute am Stück. Danach rollt\nes sich zusammen und ruht sich aus.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es capaz de desencajar la mandíbula para\nengullir presas enteras mayores que él mismo,\ntras lo cual se enrosca para descansar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Può sganciare la mandibola per ingoiare intere\nprede più grosse di lui. Dopo il pasto, si\narrotola su se stesso per riposarsi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "By dislocating its jaw, it can swallow prey larger\nthan itself. After a meal, it curls up and rests.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "顎を　外すことで　自分より\n大きな　獲物も　丸呑みに　する。\n食後は　身体を　丸め　休む。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
